`;var T_=`/* The agent in the panel (2.7.1): the working strip, its steps, what it waits for, \xAB\u041C\u043E\u0438 \u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0435\xBB.
   One type scale with the chat (the owner on 118: \xAB\u0448\u0440\u0438\u0444\u0442\u044B \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043D\u044B\u0445 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043C\u0435\u0440\u043E\u0432\u2026 \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0438\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C\xBB): a title (the request) and the
   body at the chat's own --fs (it follows Normal / Large), a section's name and meta at the chat's 12 px, chips and
   buttons the panel's own. A card is the chat's cf-card; what it waits for is a section of it, not a box inside it. */
